The engine vendors model-definition and loss code from YOLOX
(https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX), Copyright (c) Megvii
Inc., Apache License 2.0, at engine/gd/vendor/yolox/ (from the
yolox==0.3.0 sdist, modified for quantisation-aware training and the
raw-head export; each modified file says so). Training downloads
Megvii's COCO-pretrained yolox_nano or yolox_tiny checkpoint at the
user's request; it carries the same Apache-2.0 license. A model
PixelKit trains from it is derived from it: distribute an exported model
